## Playing a second person

Some steps need a second person: a reviewer who approves your change, or the
platform team who approves your request. You play them. Keep your own login in
your normal browser window, and open a **private window** for the other person
(Edge and Chrome: Ctrl+Shift+N, on a Mac Cmd+Shift+N; Firefox: Ctrl+Shift+P, on a
Mac Cmd+Shift+P). Sign in there as `{{ pelab_reviewer_user }}` or `{{ pelab_platform_approver_user }}`,
do the step, and close the private window.

This is role-play, so every step can be done alone. At work you never share a
login: accounts are personal, and the second person is a real colleague.
